<div id="tab-history" class="tab-content"><div class="chart-grid"><article><div class="chart-heading"><h3>电压随时间变化 <small>V</small></h3><div><span class="line-key lavender">E 电动势</span><span class="line-key mint">U 端电压</span></div></div><div id="voltage-chart"></div></article><article><div class="chart-heading"><h3>溶液离子浓度 <small>mol/L</small></h3><div><span class="line-key zinc-text">Zn²⁺</span><span class="line-key blue">Cu²⁺</span></div></div><div id="concentration-chart"></div></article><article><div class="chart-heading"><h3>电流随时间变化 <small>A</small></h3><span class="line-key gold">I 总电流</span></div><div id="current-chart"></div></article><article class="insight"><div class="eyebrow">ONE REACTION, ONE STATE</div><h3>化学变化，决定电路输出。</h3><p>随着放电，Zn²⁺ 增多、Cu²⁺ 减少，反应商 Q 上升，电动势缓慢下降。时间倍率只加速这个演化过程。</p><div class="equation">E = E° − <span>RT / 2F</span> · ln([Zn²⁺] / [Cu²⁺])</div><small>曲线与所有仪表共用模型快照；历史超过 900 点时均匀抽稀，保留起点与最新点。</small></article></div></div>
